# Signals on the top channel set a flag to 1.
# If the flag is 0, signals on the bottom channel die.
# If the flag is 1, signals on the bottom channel output 1 and set the flag to 0.
#
# To start with, the flag is 0. A signal on the bottom channel dies.
# Then the flag is set. A signal on the bottom channel gets through.
# The flag is set again. Further signals on the top channel have no effect.
#
